### ============================================
### LOCALHOST - USERS
### ============================================

### 1. Create User (Success 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Josephine Doe",
  "email": "Josephine.Doe@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "user"
}

### 2. Get all Users (Success 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### 3. Update User (Success 200) - Replace with local user ID
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/users/REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_USER_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Local User Updated"
}

### 4. Delete User (Success 200) - Replace with local user ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/users/REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_USER_ID

### 5. Validation Error (400) - Missing fields
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "No Password"
}


